OL,3,AParents who killed their baby have
OL,4,Asentences increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who "fatally battered" their
OL,7,Fthree-month-old son have had their
OL,8,F"unduly lenient" sentences for murder
OL,9,Fincreased.
OL,11,FKlevi Pirjani, 38, and 35-year-old
OL,12,FNivalda Pirjani, from Wirral,
OL,13,FMerseyside, were sentenced in April to
OL,14,Fa minimum of 19 years and 15 years in
OL,15,FApril over the death of their son,
OL,16,F13-week-old Miguel.
OL,18,FThe Court of Appeal has now increased
OL,19,FKlevi Pirjani's sentence to 21 years
OL,20,Fand six months, while Nivalda Pirjani
OL,21,Fwill have to serve 17 years and nine
OL,22,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
