OL,3,AParents who killed their baby have
OL,4,Asentences increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiguel was taken to Alder Hey
OL,7,Fchildren's hospital in November 2024.
OL,8,FHe had severe head injuries and died
OL,9,Ffive days after being admitted.
